# Discord Component

Discord webhook adapter that formats monitoring events as rich embeds for channel notifications.

## Key Integration Pattern
Implements Source interface with Discord-specific embed formatting and webhook delivery via standard HTTP client.

## Important Constraints
- Format events as Discord embeds with color coding (red for alerts)
- Handle webhook rate limits with appropriate error types for metrics tracking